keywords:
  - ECG
  - R-peak detection
  - benchmarking
  - heart rate variability
  - offline evaluation
  - online evaluation
  - electrocardiography
abstract: >-
  A benchmarking framework for evaluating open-source ECG R-peak detection
  algorithms across five heterogeneous datasets in offline and online
  scenarios. The framework supports performance assessment using F1-Score,
  Jitter F1, and computational time, as well as statistical comparisons
  across datasets and window lengths.
